Setting: A = −A ⊂ Z\{0}, F = 1̂_A, G = F + K, B_t = {m ∈ A : m − t ∈ A, m + t ∉ A}, f_t = 2(1 + sin 2πtx)F.
Identity (lead re-derived): f_t∗f_t = (4 − 2cos 2πtx)F + 2e(−tx)1̂_{A∩(A+2t)} + 8 Im 1̂_{A∩(A+t)}.
